RELEASE HISTORY

1.11.3 30/04/2018
! Display AJAX page call errors

1.11.2 07/12/2017
! Do not show admin-specific buttons in non-encounter grids
! Accidental reintroduction of ADD.Client namespace in ReportLink field

1.11.1 31/10/2017
! Non-inclusion of changes to v1.10.x branch

1.11.0 31/10/2017
+ Support for controller name setting in Grid sub-classes
+ Additional services made available through AddItemController
+ Improved grid error handling
+ Admin-specific delete/edit buttons in grids

1.10.0 17/08/2017
+ Implemented approach to specify required fields in linked grid fields
+ Empty value option for GotoPageFieldCell
+ Encounter data extraction classes to facilitate web service-based tables
! Timestamp parameter added to stop caching in IE
+ Admin-specific delete/edit added for encounter grids

1.9.6 27/04/2017
! EncounterMatrix was displaying number of rows rather than columns-1

1.9.5 27/04/2017
! Unable to link multiple table columns to fields

1.9.4 21/04/2017
! Resolved issues with parent encounters in MultiEncounterCreate

1.9.3 17/03/2017
! Fatal error when opening breathlessness module

1.9.2 27/01/2017
! Save and add another failing in modals

1.9.1 20/01/2017
! Incorrect function signature in DictionaryGrid

1.9.0 13/01/2017
+ Container classes to enable more flexible Angular tables
+ Refined client JS to use services rather than implement directly in controllers

1.8.1 02/11/2016
! Site title is 'undefined' if site tag not used in system

1.8.0 01/11/2016
+ Introduced field populate for linked records
! Confirm patient fixed for section-based encounters
! Still using parent encounters instead of sections for some queries
+ Support for cell-specific grid actions
+ Multiple cell value link field
* Parametised InactivateRecord action
+ Debug log output to web if in AJAX calls
+ Support to display remote site encounters
+ Support for panel-based page updates
! Prevent modal being closed if click off or press Escape
+ Support for force reload other panels
! Problem with dictionary item storage if new group
! Include field events added every update

1.7.3 16/03/2016
! No info message displayed if no modal repeat sections

1.7.2 15/03/2016
! Add button still displayed if no 'create' permission

1.7.1 03/03/2016
! Collated encounters not displayed if view permission not given for individual pages

1.7.0 29/02/2016
+ Allow use of dictionary group to filter encounter grid rows

1.6.1 22/02/2016
! Remove EncounterGrid error dialog and replace with error bar

1.6.0 09/02/2016
* Moved date range pages to client
+ Support for 'badge' page setting for encounter grids and modals
! Show scroll bar if table too wide
+ Support for collated records

1.5.1 13/01/2016
! Link records displaying IDs rather than other linking information
! Grid/matrix column widths being ignored

1.5.0 11/01/2016
+ 'include_fields' setting to pass data back to the API
+ Loading image now superimposed over existing data
+ Support for section/domains
+ Additional unlink button for columns which have disappeared
+ Warnings when matrix cell has multiple options
+ Switched out 'observation_note' table for 'note' field

1.4.0 04/11/2015
+ Support for CollatedEncounters described using JSON config file in <mod-path>/collate
+ DeleteRecord.hide_messages page setting adding for row action

1.3.0
+ Renamed unused AngularDropdown to LinkGridDropdown
+ Removed hard-coded settings in LinkGridDropdown
+ LinkColumn action to link columns in EncounterMatrix fields to a LinkRecord field
+ Support for AJAX updateable fields - initially AngularDropdown created
* Improved support for automatic creation of repeat sections when adding records
* EditRecord changed to edit modal content
+ EditPage action added to deal with page edits

1.2.0 29/07/2015
+ Support for linking sets to records via the parent id and an angular-based dropdown
+ Autolink with new modal-based records/parent records created
+ Optional 'Save and add another' button added to AbstractGridAdd button
! Corrected problem with matrix field output
* Don't show numbers of rows in matrix fields
+ Modal size increased to fill screen
+ Improved support for Locking/RequireFields component in AngularJS modals
+ Enable edit and view through the API page Submit class
+ Automatically remove link if record is deleted
+ Implemented simple EmbeddedForm which is pulled as modal/content page
+ Improved modal javascript by isolating it for each page
+ Support for table column widths
+ ViewRecord action to display data
+ Initial version of FormController for embedding forms
+ NgController field now requires 'controller' setting
! Critical JS fix in IE when modals are embedded in a form
+ Support for Angular menu update with module setting 'menu_refreshable' and new MenuController
! Added AJAX timestamps to prevent IE caching data
+ Angular controller activated in Modal RepeatSection
! Removed ng-app attributes which duplicate JS angular.bootstrap() directives

1.1.8 22/07/2015
+ Create grid row action to link row to record

1.1.7 09/07/2015
+ Support for multiple filters in encounter_grid settings
! Grid is always shown during loading of data (even if loading_disabled)
+ Angular 'timeToDate' filter added to convert ISO time d/m/y date

1.1.6 08/07/2015
* Added support for 'list_pattern' setting to indicate how AngularJS data is output in ModalRepeatSection

1.1.5 24/06/2015
* Improved support for parent-based encounter searches
+ Support for 'before_row_actions'
* Changed 'Show referral' to 'Edit' in EditRecord action
! AJAX errors/warnings are being lost when multiple AJAX calls are made

1.1.4 26/05/2015
! Modal validation switched back on
+ Dictionary item modal/grid support

1.1.3 12/05/2015
! Warnings being shown in pre tags
! EncounterGrid child fields we not using 'label' key in data
* 'pid' parameter made optional in encounters API call
+ Support added for new patient 'specialStatus' enum parameter
+ Support added for null filter field
+ EditRecord button added which opens specific encounter page
! Incorrect null comparison for filter value

1.1.2 05/05/2015
! Resolved issue with header creation and variables
+ Unit test to confirm empty table returned if no records
! Prevent display of ModalRepeatSection option if no access
* Changed width of menu options

1.1.1 01/05/2015
! Rather than single blank entry matrix API now returns no data if no records
! Prevent no page being passed to addItem function when adding an item using a modal

1.1.0 29/04/2015
+ AngularJS-based client module
+ EncounterGrid and EncounterMatrix fields added which automatically update
+ InactivateRecord and DeleteEncounter row action classes created
! IE returning Angular-related HTML attributes in mixed case
+ ModalContent page to guide output of form content only
* Improvements to grid addition fields allowing the button/dropdown to be part of a repeat section
* Improved error handling in modal content along with wait alerts
+ Encounters API output performance improved through use of sub-queries
* Moved client specific classes into ADD_Client
* Added ModalRepeatSection which is AngularJS based
* Provided dataurl option to grid update so it can use other web-service URLs to retrieve data
* Separated matrix data conversion into class
! Fixed IE7 problem with patientid URL parameter

1.0.0 28/10/2014
* Isolated from core modules for common use in v2.1 and v3.0 developments
* Refined grid action button
+ Row action option for each row in grid
* Removed ajax loader animation due to short time
! 'containing' settings added to base WebClient field
+ Ability to use multiple JS updater classes
+ 'no_count' and 'no_description' settings added to Grid field (no_count - title is used as a heading, no_description - displayed below when there are no entries)
+ Hide action buttons when read only state
